# Ignore all runtime-deployed skills (e.g., cc-*, explain-context)
# Only track the neovim integration skills explicitly listed below
# Skills are flat .md files — Auggie reads skills/<name>.md pattern
*

# Whitelist: un-ignore the neovim skill directories (git won't descend
# into ignored dirs, so these must be re-included before their contents)
!using-neovim/
!using-neovim-lsp/
!using-quickfix/

# Re-ignore everything inside them…
using-neovim/*
using-neovim-lsp/*
using-quickfix/*

# …except the SKILL.md files tracked in dotfiles
!using-neovim/SKILL.md
!using-neovim-lsp/SKILL.md
!using-quickfix/SKILL.md

# Whitelist: this file itself
!.gitignore
